Diagnostic-only telemetry supplement to kexec_secure_sp_tz_reclaim_diag_6.6.89.patch.

Apply after the base helper patch to the frozen b99466b source. trace_scm=0
preserves its execution/logging behavior; trace_scm=1 adds four SCM-module
kprobes and normal-context best-effort console flushing. No register, stack,
SCM argument, assignment count, seal/heap guard or target zeroing is changed.
External preflight must match SCM Build ID45818a2df3a2eb3401fae24aa624f6c312d5d9f9,
source8dde72278b557d4fd2488c1cab40759e890397bc and the only enabled consoles
ttynull0 and ramoops-1. Missing output is never proof that an instruction did
not execute. Kprobe/printk/console attempts alter timing and are diagnostic only.

